# curto API tour for the VS Code "REST Client" extension and the JetBrains HTTP client.
# Start the server first (see CONTRIBUTING.md), then send the requests top to bottom.

@host = http://127.0.0.1:5080
@key = local-development-key-123
@slug = hello

### Liveness: the process is up (no key needed)
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Readiness: the database answers, plus click-pipeline counters
GET {{host}}/readyz

### Create a link with a custom slug, a title and tags
POST {{host}}/api/links
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/blog/hello-world",
  "slug": "{{slug}}",
  "title": "Hello world",
  "tags": ["blog", "launch"]
}

### Create a link with a random 7-character slug, a click budget and an expiry
POST {{host}}/api/links
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/limited-offer",
  "title": "Limited offer",
  "maxClicks": 100,
  "expiresAt": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### A validation error: every problem is reported, keyed by field name
POST {{host}}/api/links
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "ftp://example.com/file",
  "slug": "a",
  "tags": ["ok", "not ok!"]
}

### Read one link
GET {{host}}/api/links/{{slug}}
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### List links: filter by text and status, sort by clicks, page with limit and offset
GET {{host}}/api/links?query=hello&status=active&sort=clicks&dir=desc&limit=20&offset=0
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Update with a JSON merge patch: present fields change, null clears, absent fields stay
PATCH {{host}}/api/links/{{slug}}
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json

{
  "title": "Hello again",
  "tags": ["blog"],
  "maxClicks": null
}

### The public redirect: answers 302 and records a click (this client does not follow it)
# @no-redirect
GET {{host}}/{{slug}}
Referer: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=1
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64; rv:125.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/125.0

### A HEAD request is a link check, not a visit: same answer, nothing recorded
# @no-redirect
HEAD {{host}}/{{slug}}

### QR code of the short URL as SVG (public)
GET {{host}}/qr/{{slug}}.svg?size=192&dark=1a2b3c&light=ffffff

### Statistics across all links: 24h, 7d, 30d or 90d
GET {{host}}/api/stats/overview?range=7d
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Statistics of one link (same shape; links.total is 1)
GET {{host}}/api/links/{{slug}}/stats?range=30d
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Live click stream (Server-Sent Events). Leave it open and click the short link elsewhere.
GET {{host}}/api/events
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### No key: 401 with a WWW-Authenticate challenge and a problem document
GET {{host}}/api/links

### Delete the link and its analytics
DELETE {{host}}/api/links/{{slug}}
X-API-Key: {{key}}
